From 6008745248d6e1c8e0cf88375a877d481b047079 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SacredRebel <paulmuresan77@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 20 Oct 2025 13:52:22 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(public-site): add Phase 1 public website scaffolding

- Save guiding doc under `website - updates/phase-1-public-website-plan.md`
- Extend Tailwind/CSS variables with sacred palette (sage, clay, sand, ivory, ink)
- Add public shared components (Header, Footer, PageHero, Section, RealmCard, SpiralDivider, ContactForm)
- Add basic icons (Leaf, Moon, Spiral)
- Add SEO helper (src/lib/seo.ts)
- Implement public pages: Home, Physical, Mental, Spiritual, Journey, Contact, Initiates
- Wire routes in App.tsx (public at /; existing app at /app)
- Add image placeholders under public/images/placeholders
- Enable smooth scrolling

Note: Vite dev server runs via `node node_modules/vite/bin/vite.js` due to `&` in path on Windows.
